        "message": "[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.1] Creator of the SBOM missing (email address, or URL if no email is available); generation tools (metadata.tools) do not satisfy the field — provide a Person/Organization creator (e.g. CycloneDX metadata.authors or metadata.manufacturer)",
        "element": null,
