            "standard": "BsiTr03183_2",
            "id": "§5.2.2",
            "help_uri": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en"
          }
        ],
        "remediation": "Provide the hash of the deployed/deployable component as SHA-512 — §5.2.2 names the algorithm, so SHA-256 or other algorithms alone do not satisfy the required field (additional hashes may coexist). SPDX 3.0: add a verifiedUsing[] Hash entry with algorithm sha512.",
        "help_uri": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en"
      },
