        "remediation": "Add unique identifiers (purl, CPE) to components. §5.2.4 is the additional tier: the field MUST be provided when an identifier exists for the component. SPDX 3.0: set software_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier[] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.",
