          {
            "standard": "Eo14028",
            "id": "EO 14028 §4",
            "help_uri": "https://www.federalregister.gov/d/2021-10460"
          }
        ],
        "remediation": "Follow the SBOM practice of EO 14028 §4(e): use a machine-readable format (CycloneDX 1.4+, SPDX 2.2+, or SPDX 3.0+), generate the SBOM with a tool, and include unique identifiers, versions, hashes, dependencies and supplier information. This is practice, not a federal mandate: OMB M-26-05 rescinded the M-22-18 attestation requirement, though an agency may still ask for an SBOM in its contract. SPDX 3.0: set software_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier[] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.",
        "help_uri": "https://www.federalregister.gov/d/2021-10460"
      },
